    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Activates the Entrance Animation when there is a \"Goku's Family\" or\n\"Pure Saiyans\" Category enemy or an enemy whose name includes\n\"Gohan (Kid)\" at the start of the character's attacking turn*\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}Extreme Class allies' Ki +3 and ATK & DEF 18%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When HP is 50% or more*\n- ATK 100%{passiveImg:up_g} and DEF 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack\n- Launches an additional Super Attack when HP is 50% or less\n- {passiveImg:once}ATK 400%{passiveImg:up_g} and DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every Super Attack performed*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Ki +3 (up to +9)\n- {passiveImg:forever}Damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 30%)\n- {passiveImg:forever}DEF 80%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 240%)\n*After performing 6 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Attacks are effective against all Types\n- {passiveImg:forever}Launches an additional Super Attack\n*When there is another \"Space-Traveling Warriors\" Category ally\nattacking in the same turn*\n- {passiveImg:once}Damage reduction rate 70%{passiveImg:up_g} before attacking",
